<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel fire inquiry report 0845 GMT.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel fire inquiry report 0845 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel is scheduled to reveal at 0845 GMT on Thursday the findings of an internal inquiry into last November's fire in the sub-sea tunnel link it operates between between Britain and France.</p>
<p>The Anglo-French company plans to issue a statement on its inquiry at 0845 GMT and also plans to present the results at a news conference in the French port of Calais on Thursday morning.</p>
<p>The November fire damaged a large section of one of the sub-sea tunnels and hit passenger and freight services.</p>
</text>
